 "about_text": "nca | nichido contemporary art is a Tokyo gallery founded in 2002 as the contemporary branch of galerie nichido, itself established in 1928 as the first gallery in Japan to introduce Western painting. Building on that gallery's pioneering approach, nca focuses on introducing emerging Japanese and international artists working today. Since opening a branch in Taipei in 2015, the gallery has expanded its program to actively support and present contemporary art from across Asia, alongside artists from Europe and the Americas. The gallery is located in Roppongi, Tokyo, and participates regularly in international art fairs.",
